      "image_sources": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Mix olive oil and grill seasoning together in a large bowl. Add potato wedges and toss to coat.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Line 2 baking sheets with aluminum foil. Crumple up foil slightly and grease with cooking spray. Arrange potato wedges on the foil so that they are not touching and have enough room to cook.",
